@dir src
@brief Folder with C++ source files.

@details
This folder contains the `.cpp` implementation files for the
µOS++ Tracing Infrastructure library. Each file provides the
non-inline definitions for one layer of the API.

The files are compiled into the library only when
`MICRO_OS_PLUS_DIAG_TRACE_ENABLED` is defined. When tracing is disabled, all
calls resolve to empty inline stubs and these files contribute
no object code.
